# =====================================================
# Ingestion API - Test Requests
# =====================================================

### GET: Últimos eventos detectados
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ingestion/last-detected-events?limit=50
Accept: application/json

### GET: Estatísticas de coleção
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ingestion/collection-statistics?initialDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-14
Accept: application/json

### POST: Registrar Data Source
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ingestion/data-source
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Estacao Meteorologica A",
  "dataSourceType": "WeatherStation",
  "measurementType": "Temperature",
  "endpoint": "http://sensor.local/api",
  "collectionFrequency": "10m"
}

### POST: Registrar Sensor Collection
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ingestion/sensor-collection
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "datasourceId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "tenantId": "987e6543-e21b-12d3-a456-426614174999",
  "collectedAt": "2025-12-14T18:00:00",
  "payload": "{ \"temperature\": 28.5 }",
  "sampleSensors": [
    {
      "sensorId": "111e2222-e33b-44d5-a555-666777888999",
      "value": 28.5,
      "unit": "Celsius"
    },
    {
      "sensorId": "222e3333-e44b-55d5-a666-777888999000",
      "value": 29.1,
      "unit": "Celsius"
    }
  ]
}
